Reasons:

- Track A fails: Theorem 2 explicitly gives polynomial-time SDP recovery on the proposed planted distribution; Theorem 3 also identifies efficient recovery throughout the feasible regime. [Full paper](https://arxiv.org/html/1507.05605v2)
- The prior verifier—comparing against secret planted labels—violates the witness rule.
